  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "For users of Driver4Vr’s Kinect implementation in particular, it doesn’t ever show the trackers as “disconnected”. So even if I start up VRC with D4VR off, VRC wants me to use my trackers and calibrate them properly. I’d like to see a feature to turn off full body tracking so that I can play without tracking, without having to uninstall Driver4VR.",
